      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1bf7h3k'
    '|a||Спроси́л: поинтересова́лся, asked with interest; уточни́л, asked to be exact. Then ли, or the question word.':
